# Cloud Build upload context — keep it tiny. The Dockerfile only needs
# src/granum/__init__.py, src/granum/web, and api_data.
#
# IMPORTANT: leading-slash anchors these to the REPO ROOT. An unanchored "web/"
# would also match src/granum/web (which the image needs) and break the build.
/.git/
/.venv/
/.scratch/
/runs/
/web/
/tests/
/research/
/videos/
/data/
/.env
# Safe to exclude everywhere (don't exist under src/):
node_modules/
.next/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.log
